md = ["# Plan weeks 1-6 (9 Nov - 20 Dec 2026), as of 28 Nov (chat 4)", "",
      "Planning FTP 175 W (12 Nov hour test; reset by the 20-min test on Tue 1 Dec). Since 26-27 Nov the KICKR reads about 3.5% below the Stages (KICKR ERG 175 W = Stages 181 W): Stages values are the reference; KICKR ERG targets about 3% lower until the ratio is rechecked (aerobic check #2, 5 Dec). Stages zero offset: weekly indoors (first indoor ride of the week) and before every check, test and outdoor ride. Easy riding: KICKR 120-130 W (cap 140), Stages 115-125 W (cap 135), 85-90 rpm. Steady state: week 2 158-164 W (90-94%), week 3 none (the 10-min test instead), week 4 none (the 20-min test), week 5 1 x 20 at 95-98% and 2 x 10 at 97-100%, week 6 2 x 10 at 98-100% of the FTP set on 1 Dec (revised 28 Nov; with FTP 175: 166-172 / 170-175 / 172-175 W). Fan: level 2 for checks and intervals (from 17 Nov), level 3 for tests of 10 min or more, level 1 for easy rides. Run HR zones from 17 Nov: Z1 <=149, Z2 150-163, Z3 164-172, Z4 173-187, Z5 >=188 (LTHR 181). Weeks 1-3 are done except the weekend of 28-29 Nov (indoor Z2, the century moved); week 4 was rebuilt on 28 Nov around a provisional century on Sun 6 Dec (20-min test Tue 1 Dec, run Thu 3 Dec, aerobic check Sat 5 Dec); weeks 5-6 are a sketch, tweaked before each week starts. Run days are provisional (Wednesday first, Tue/Thu possible; guard windows in coach_notes.md section 7).", "",
      "| Week | Date | Session | Where | Duration | Targets | Checks | Status |", "|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|"]
